para.p:
In line with our role in an OECD task force to develop a monitoring mechanism for applying the G7 Hiroshima Code of Conduct for Organisations Developing Advanced AI Systems, we have organized our model alignment work with the OECD values-based AI principles:4footnote 44footnote 4https://oecd.ai/en/ai-principles inclusive growth, sustainable development and well-being;
human-centered values and fairness;
transparency and explainability;
robustness, security and safety; and
accountability.
